  "description": "Comfort by name, comfort by nature.\nThe Reid Comfort range is designed to make riding a bicycle a breeze. With both regular and low step models in the lineup there’s a comfortable and accessible choice available for all.\nThroughout the Comfort models we have focused the geometry to give a relaxed and upright posture, and the componentry to reduce impact on the rider. This reduces the fatigue and subsequent stress from cycling to enhance the rider’s experience.\nThe Comfort 3 comes equipped with Shimano 24 speed Tourney EZfire for a wider gear range and powerful cable disc brakes for confident and controlled stopping no matter the weather. Wheels are built using 27.5” double wall alloy rims fitted with 2.35” all terrain tyres for a silky-smooth ride no matter the surface.\nTo add to that already smooth ride, the Comfort 3 has an 80mm travel suspension fork, reducing shocks through the whole bike. Finished with ergonomic handlebars, ergo grips, and a comfort saddle we are confident the Comfort range is the perfect way to get cycling for as little effort as possible.\nA true embodiment of our pillars of quality and value, there’s never been a better way to hop on and hit up some smooth miles at your own speed.",
